msgstr "Stopped working"

#. Accessible name of the list of the profile's tabs down the left of the window, read by screen readers
#. Name of the menu of commands on the selected profile's tabs
#: src/main/application-menu.ts
#: src/shell/tab-strip.tsx
msgid "Tabs"
msgstr "Tabs"

#. Shown in the unified inbox when no profile has unread mail
#: src/shell/inbox.tsx
msgid "The unified inbox shows the unread mail of every profile in one place. A message leaves the list once it is read."
msgstr "The unified inbox shows the unread mail of every profile in one place. A message leaves the list once it is read."

#. Shown when the app is started on data that a later version of the app wrote, which this version cannot read
#: src/main/store-file.ts
msgid "This data was saved by a newer version. Open it with that version, or update to it."
msgstr "This data was saved by a newer version. Open it with that version, or update to it."

#. Accessible name of the strip across the top of the window, read by screen readers
